        },
        "firstLine" : {
          "zh" : "\u55E1\u9E23\u5BE1\u5987\u7528\u7A7A\u6D1E\u7684\u76EE\u5149\u76EF\u7740\u4F60\u3002\n\n\n\u5979\u7684\u866B\u7FA4\u4EE4\u4EBA\u7A92\u606F\u5730\u805A\u62E2\u5728\u4F60\u5468\u56F4\uFF0C\u55E1\u55E1\u58F0\u8D8A\u6765\u8D8A\u54CD\u3002\n\n\n\u90A3\u65E0\u4F11\u6B62\u7684\u55E1\u9E23\u8D34\u7740\u4F60\u7684\u76AE\u80A4\u4E0E\u5FC3\u7075\uFF0C\u5BFB\u627E\u6700\u7EC6\u5FAE\u7684\u7F1D\u9699\u6E17\u5165\u5176\u4E2D\u3002",
          "en" : "The Humming Widow fixes you with an empty stare.\n\n\nHer swarms gather oppressively around you, growing louder and louder.\n\n\nTheir ceaseless buzzing presses against both your skin and your mind, searching for the smallest openings through which to seep.",
          "ja" : "The Humming Widow fixes you with an empty stare.\n\n\nHer swarms gather oppressively around you, growing louder and louder.\n\n\nTheir ceaseless buzzing presses against both your skin and your mind, searching for the smallest openings through which to seep."
        }
      },
